- [FastChat](https://github.com/modelscope/agentscope/blob/main/scripts/README.md#fastchat)
- [vllm](https://github.com/modelscope/agentscope/blob/main/scripts/README.md#vllm)

**Supported Services**

- Web Search
- Data Query
- Retrieval
- Code Execution
- File Operation
- Text Processing

